@luukvbaal 
> Can we not just drop this?

I'll happily remove the code related to `v:echospace` from ui2 and also the mention in the docs according to which it still has a purpose. It agree that it would make things easier :) In that case, should I leave the cropping unit tests? I'm not sure how much of it is by design or just unfinished work, only setting `v:echospace` depended on agreed behaviour. I don't want to interfere with active development.
